    "aiDescription": {
      "summary": "The bill adds four areas in the Angeles National Forest to the National Wilderness Preservation System: Condor Peak, San Gabriel, Sheep Mountain, and Yerba Buena. It applies to federal lands in the Angeles National Forest, withdraws them from mineral entry, and directs the Secretary to manage fire, wildlife, and recreation.",
