    "impact": {
      "summary": "The bill makes four new wilderness units in the Angeles National Forest\u2014Condor Peak, San Gabriel additions, Sheep Mountain additions, and Yerba Buena\u2014and withdraws them from mining and mineral leasing. The U.S. Forest Service will administer them and update fire plans with State and local agencies.",
